      "message": "Suggest building Mesa from source:\n\n`git clone https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa.git`\n\n`meson setup amd64-build/ -Dvulkan-drivers\u003d\"intel\" -Dgallium-drivers\u003d\"\" -Dopengl\u003dfalse`\n\nThen point `VK_ICD_FILENAMES` to the Intel dev ICD.\n\nAnother way to test: is `vkGetImageDrmFormatModifierPropertiesEXT` called by the amdgpu path?  That\u0027ll confirm if it\u0027s an Intel specific bug or not.",
